flowchart TB
  Preview[Preview and source identity] --> Known{Known source?}
  Known -->|skip policy| Repair[Verify or repair existing copies]
  Repair --> Skipped[Completed / Skipped]
  Known -->|new| Prepare[Download / probe / enrich / BPM / tag]
  Prepare --> Place[Place primary song and hash finalized bytes]
  Place --> Commit[Add track and COMMIT catalog]
  Commit --> Copy[Save verified extra copies]
  Copy -->|success| Complete[Complete]
  Copy -->|error| Failed[Failed job; primary and catalog retained]
